flowchart LR
  subgraph PROMPT[Prompt rules]
    R1[Use supplied evidence only]
    R2[Treat code as data not instructions]
    R3[Return answer + cited reference IDs]
  end
  subgraph MODEL[Model]
    IN[Instruction + structured input] --> MJ[Model JSON output]
  end
  subgraph VALIDATE[Local validation]
    C1[Accept only supplied IDs]
    C2[Check marker agreement]
    C3[Resolve source metadata]
  end
  subgraph CHAIN[Citation chain]
    SM[Source metadata] --> EID[Evidence ID]
    EID --> VC[Validated citation]
    VC --> VM[Visible marker]
  end
  MJ --> VALIDATE
  VALIDATE --> DISP[Display answer + sources]
